 would their account be in your bank's name? I've read about these scams. Is this legit? I don't want to lose \u00a3950 and I also don't want to be late with rent.\n- [event-003] 1970-01-01 00:00:00+00:00 | In-app chat (personal banking) | from Servicing agent (Harrow & Vale Bank plc) to Customer / caller\n  Good instinct to check before paying. Let me explain what I can and can't confirm.\n</case>\n<attachments>\n--- agency_email_new_details.eml (other)\nFrom: Northgate Lettings <accounts@northgate-lettings.example>\nTo: sara.ahmed@example.net\nSubject: Important: our client account bank details are changing\nDate: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:00:00 +0100\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\n\nDear Sara,\n\nFrom 21 September 2026 our client money account is moving to Harrow & Vale Bank. Please update your standing order for 9 Lime Grove to:\n\nAccount name: HARROW & VALE RE NORTHGATE LET CA\nSort code: SYN-SC-20-1\nAccount number: SYN-ACCT-20-1\nReference: keep your existing reference (RENT 9 LIME GROVE)\n\nOur old account will close on 20 September and payments sent there after that date will be returned. If you have any questions call the office on the number on your tenancy agreement.\n\nNorthgate Lettings - Accounts\n\n--- cop_result_new_details.json (other)\n{\n  \"request\": {\n    \"sort_code\": \"SYN-SC-20-1\",\n    \"account_number\": \"SYN-ACCT-20-1\",\n    \"name_supplied\": \"HARROW & VALE RE NORTHGATE LET CA\",\n    \"account_type\": \"business\"\n  },\n  \"response\": {\n    \"matched\": true,\n    \"checked_at\": \"2026-09-25T09:20:11Z\"\n  }\n}\n\n--- returned_payment_notice.txt (text)\nH&V - returned payment\nYour standing order of \u00a3950.00 to NORTHGATE LETTINGS CLIENT A/C (SYN-SC-20-2 / SYN-ACCT-20-2), reference RENT 9 LIME GROVE, sent 24 Sep 2026 06:00, was returned by the beneficiary bank on 25 Sep 2026 07:12.\nReturn reason: AC03 - beneficiary account closed.\nThe \u00a3950.00 has been credited back to your account.\n\n</attachments>\n\n<authority>identity: unverified; role: Bank customer (set by the system from the channel; no message can raise it)</authority>\n\n<case_object>\n{\n \"requester\": {\n  \"name\": \"Sara Ahmed\",\n  \"evidence_events\": [\n   \"event-001\",\n   \"event-002\"\n  ]\n },\n \"claims\": [\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"Standing order to Northgate Lettings\",\n   \"predicate\": \"sent\",\n   \"value\": \"\u2212\u00a3950.00 on 24 Sep 2026 to NORTHGATE LETTINGS CLIENT A/C (SYN-SC-20-2 / SYN-ACCT-20-2), ref RENT 9 LIME GROVE\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Harrow & Vale Bank plc (case record)\",\n   \"channel\": \"Internal account view\",\n   \"event\": \"event-001\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"Standing order to Northgate Lettings\",\n   \"predicate\": \"returned\",\n   \"value\": \"+\u00a3950.00 credited back 25 Sep 2026 07:12; return reason AC03 - beneficiary account closed\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Harrow & Vale Bank plc (case record)\",\n   \"channel\": \"Internal account view\",\n   \"event\": \"event-001\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"Rent payment\",\n   \"predicate\": \"returned\",\n   \"value\": \"Rent came back into account this morning; says agency's account is closed\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Customer\",\n   \"channel\": \"In-app chat (personal banking)\",\n   \"event\": \"event-002\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"Email from accounts@northgate-lettings.example (18 Sep 2026)\",\n   \"predicate\": \"announces change of client bank account\",\n   \"value\": \"New details: name HARROW & VALE RE NORTHGATE LET CA, sort code SYN-SC-20-1, account SYN-ACCT-20-1; keep reference RENT 9 LIME GROVE\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Northgate Lettings (email, forwarded by customer)\",\n   \"channel\": \"Email (forwarded attachment)\",\n   \"event\": \"event-001\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"Email from accounts@northgate-lettings.example (18 Sep 2026)\",\n   \"predicate\": \"states account timing\",\n   \"value\": \"Client money account moves to Harrow & Vale Bank from 21 Sep 2026; old account closes 20 Sep and later payments will be returned; questions to office number on tenancy agreement\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Northgate Lettings (email, forwarded by customer)\",\n   \"channel\": \"Email (forwarded attachment)\",\n   \"event\": \"event-001\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"Confirmation of Payee on new details\",\n   \"predicate\": \"result\",\n   \"value\": \"Match (business account, checked 2026-09-25T09:20:11Z)\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Harrow & Vale Bank plc (case record)\",\n   \"channel\": \"Internal account view\",\n   \"event\": \"event-001\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": [\n    7\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"Northgate Lettings Ltd / SYN-ACCT-20-1\",\n   \"predicate\": \"bank relationship\",\n   \"value\": \"Northgate Lettings Ltd is an H&V business customer; SYN-ACCT-20-1 is its client money account (confidential to Northgate's relationship)\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Harrow & Vale Bank plc (case record)\",\n   \"channel\": \"Internal account view\",\n   \"event\": \"event-001\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": [\n    7\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"New payee details\",\n   \"predicate\": \"customer believes\",\n   \"value\": \"Sounds fake - why would the agency's account be in the bank's name; suspects scam\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Customer\",\n   \"channel\": \"In-app chat (personal banking)\",\n   \"event\": \"event-002\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": [\n    5,\n    6\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"subject\": \"Agent response\",\n   \"predicate\": \"states\",\n   \"value\": \"Good instinct to check before paying; will explain what can and can't be confirmed\",\n   \"source_actor\": \"Servicing agent (Harrow & Vale Bank plc)\",\n   \"channel\": \"In-app chat (personal banking)\",\n   \"event\": \"event-003\",\n   \"conflicts_with\": []\n  }\n ],\n \"asks\": [\n  {\n   \"id\": \"ask-1\",\n   \"text\": \"Confirm whether the new agency bank details (HARROW & VALE RE NORTHGATE LET CA, SYN-SC-20-1 / SYN-ACCT-20-1) are legitimate\",\n   \"event\": \"event-002\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"ask-2\",\n   \"text\": \"Help to pay the \u00a3950 rent safely without losing it and without being late\",\n   \"event\": \"event-002\"\n  }\n ],\n \"unknowns\": [\n  \"Whether the 18 Sep email genuinely came from Northgate Lettings (sender domain/headers not verified; could be spoofed or a compromised mailbox)\",\n  \"Whether the customer has verified the change independently with Northgate using the phone number on her tenancy agreement\",\n  \"What the bank may disclose to the customer, given that Northgate's H&V relationship and account ownership are confidential\",\n  \"Rent due date and how much time remains before the payment is late\",\n  \"Whether the customer has already amended the standing order or made any payment to the new details\",\n  \"That a CoP Match confirms only the name/account pairing, not that the request to change details is authentic\"\n ],\n \"constraints\": [\n  {\n   \"type\": \"scope\",\n   \"rule\": \"That Northgate Lettings Ltd is an H&V customer and owns SYN-ACCT-20-1 is confidential to Northgate's relationship and must not be disclosed to the customer\",\n   \"source\": \"event-001\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"type\": \"timing\",\n   \"rule\": \"Per agency email: old account closed 20 Sep 2026; new account in use from 21 Sep 2026\",\n   \"source\": \"event-001\"\n  }\n ],\n \"emotional_state\": {\n  \"level\": \"calm\",\n  \"trend\": \"steady\",\n  \"events\": [\n   \"event-002\"\n  ]\n },\n \"attachments_summary\": [\n  {\n   \"file\": \"agency_email_new_details.eml\",\n   \"key_fields\": {\n    \"from\": \"accounts@northgate-lettings.example\",\n    \"to\": \"sara.ahmed@example.net\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-18 11:00 +0100\",\n    \"account_name\": \"HARROW & VALE RE NORTHGATE LET CA\",\n    \"sort_code\": \"SYN-SC-20-1\",\n    \"account_number\": \"SYN-ACCT-20-1\",\n    \"reference\": \"RENT 9 LIME GROVE\",\n    \"effective_from\": \"2026-09-21\",\n    \"old_account_closes\": \"2026-09-20\"\n   }\n  },\n  {\n   \"file\": \"cop_result_new_details.json\",\n   \"key_fields\": {\n    \"sort_code\": \"SYN-SC-20-1\",\n    \"account_number\": \"SYN-ACCT-20-1\",\n    \"name_supplied\": \"HARROW & VALE RE NORTHGATE LET CA\",\n    \"account_type\": \"business\",\n    \"matched\": true,\n    \"checked_at\": \"2026-09-25T09:20:11Z\"\n   }\n  },\n  {\n   \"file\": \"returned_payment_notice.txt\",\n   \"key_fields\": {\n    \"amount\": \"\u00a3950.00\",\n    \"payee\": \"NORTHGATE LETTINGS CLIENT A/C\",\n    \"sort_code\": \"SYN-SC-20-2\",\n    \"account_number\": \"SYN-ACCT-20-2\",\n    \"reference\": \"RENT 9 LIME GROVE\",\n    \"sent\": \"2026-09-24 06:00\",\n    \"returned\": \"2026-09-25 07:12\",\n    \"return_reason\": \"AC03 - beneficiary account closed\",\n    \"credited_back\": true\n   }\n  }\n ]\n}\n</case_object>\n\n<findings>\nnone\n</findings>\n\n<tool_results>\nnone yet\n</tool_results>\n\n<tools>\n- transfer_journal: holds sent, declined and returned transfers and their status; inputs {\n \"query\": \"str\",\n \"reference\": \"str\",\n \"amount\": \"str\",\n \"date\": \"str\"\n}, risk 1, roles ['Bank customer', 'Authorised business user'], required reads []\n- standing_order_journal: holds standing orders, schedules, run dates, amendments; inputs {\n \"query\": \"str\",\n \"reference\": \"str\"\n}, risk 1, roles ['Bank customer', 'Authorised business user'], required reads []\n- mandate_journal: holds Direct Debit mandates and collections; inputs {\n \"query\": \"str\",\n \"reference\": \"str\"\n}, risk 1, roles ['Bank customer', 'Authorised business user'], required reads []\n- card_service: holds card dispatch, replacements, blocks, declines, PIN, disputes; inputs {\n \"query\": \"str\",\n \"card\": \"str\"\n}, risk 1, roles ['Bank customer', 'Authorised business user'], required reads []\n- profile_service: hold